7.7 Probability Is Not Yet a Decision
\[
\hat y_i=
\begin{cases}
1,&\hat p_i\ge\tau\\
0,&\hat p_i&lt;\tau.
\end{cases}
\]
Thus,
\[
\boxed{\text{Features}}
\rightarrow
\boxed{\text{Probability}}
\rightarrow
\boxed{\text{Threshold}}
\rightarrow
\boxed{\text{Decision}}
\rightarrow
\boxed{\text{Consequence}}.
\]

